{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new chapter of the FUR Squadron saga:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/fur_header.png?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the FUR Squadron! They will make you a true ace pilot, hone your skills before it's too late! Featuring a <strong>roguelite structure</strong> with skill trees that unlock abilities and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-warship.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showcasing intricate, dynamic, and captivating landscapes and environments. <strong>Huge bosses and fleets of enemy ships</strong>, on space, air and sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-weapons.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shiny new weapons, offering more than just conventional guided projectiles. Get ready to wield<strong> a colossal power beam, multi-missile barrages, and a powerful nuke strike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-help.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Friendship&quot; system with other characters, allowing for <strong>unlocking conversations and support skills</strong>. Our FUR Squadron pals are suiting up to have your back. Support can be summoned for reinforcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-gryllus.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it's too late?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2674650?t=1744712117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744712117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744712117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744712117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3186310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new chapter of the FUR Squadron saga:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/fur_header.png?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the FUR Squadron! They will make you a true ace pilot, hone your skills before it's too late! Featuring a <strong>roguelite structure</strong> with skill trees that unlock abilities and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-warship.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showcasing intricate, dynamic, and captivating landscapes and environments. <strong>Huge bosses and fleets of enemy ships</strong>, on space, air and sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-weapons.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shiny new weapons, offering more than just conventional guided projectiles. Get ready to wield<strong> a colossal power beam, multi-missile barrages, and a powerful nuke strike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-help.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Friendship&quot; system with other characters, allowing for <strong>unlocking conversations and support skills</strong>. Our FUR Squadron pals are suiting up to have your back. Support can be summoned for reinforcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/extras/gif-gryllus.gif?t=1744712117\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;War drums are beating at the Bist System. Alarmed by the increasing activity of the dangerous Marauders, the Chimera Federation has decided to reinforce the troops of its space fleet. A brave and determined recruit is sent to the renegade FUR Squadron for special training using their virtual reality technology. Will they manage to hone their skills before it's too late?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Raptor Claw"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674650/header.jpg?t=1744712117","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100489,"mp4