nt threat. Are you ready for the challenge?","steam_appid":2674650,"support_info":{"email":"support@raptorclawapps.com","url":"https://www.raptorclawapps.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.raptorclawapps.com/"}